detailedExplanation.whatItIs:
Failure recovery combines error feedback, bounded retries, and fallbacks. Conceptually:
try:
    result = call_with_retries(tool, args, max_retries=2)
except Unrecoverable as e:
    observation = f'error: {e}'   # tell the model
if repeated_failure(tool):
    break                          # stop looping on the same error
